    "teach_4": {
      "id": "teach_4",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The question mark can hide downstairs:\n\n3565 ÷ 23 + 4675 ÷ ? = 430\n\nFirst simplify the known block:\n\n3565 ÷ 23 = 155\n\nSo: 155 + 4675 ÷ ? = 430\nThe mystery block: 4675 ÷ ? = 430 − 155 = 275",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_4_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_4_step": {
      "id": "teach_4_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Now the block says: 4675 divided by something gives 275.\n\nIf 4675 ÷ ? = 275, then ? = 4675 ÷ 275 = 17.\n\nDividend ÷ answer = divisor.\n\nCheck: 4675 ÷ 17 = 275 ✓ and 155 + 275 = 430 ✓",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_4"
        }
      ]
    },
